{
  "_doc": "Which device shows Mochi and Coucou. Same file, byte for byte, as windows/scripts/phone/presence-vectors.json in the PC repo: both sides must agree, or both (or neither) would show him. `idle` is seconds since the last input on that device, `age_ms` how long ago the peer's beat arrived. A peer older than 15 s is ignored. The server's \"vga\" means nobody is in use: the panel has Mochi and no device does, unless one of them, screen on, was touched less than 300 s ago (the server's IDLE_LIMIT); then idle decides among those. The server calls the laptop \"pc\": clients read it as \"laptop\" before deciding.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "alone, no server: everything shows",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 500, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "link up, no server: the device used last wins (laptop's view)",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 40, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 2, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "link up, no server: the same moment seen from the phone",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 2, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 40, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "the laptop was touched last",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 90, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "a phone with its screen off never wins while the laptop is awake",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 600, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 0, "screen_on": false, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "a locked laptop gives way to the phone",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 0, "screen_on": false, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 300, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "both screens off: idle decides among all",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 100, "screen_on": false, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 20, "screen_on": false, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "everyone reaches the server and it names the phone, whatever the idle",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21"},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 500, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21", "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "mixed: the phone reaches the server, the laptop does not: idle decides (laptop's view)",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 2, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 50, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21", "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "mixed, seen from the phone: the same answer",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 50, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21"},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 2, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "the server says vga (nobody in use) but both were touched within its limit: idle decides among them",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 5, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 60, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga", "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "the server answers but disagrees between the two: idle decides",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 5, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "laptop"},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21", "age_ms": 500}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "no peer, server reachable: the server decides alone",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21"},
      "peers": [],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "a peer that went quiet more than 15 s ago is not there",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 900, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 0, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 20000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "a peer's idle keeps running while its beat ages",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 10, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 3, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 12000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "a tie goes to the same device on both sides",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 7, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 7, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 0}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "hysteresis: a small lead does not steal the island",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 2, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 0}],
      "previous": "laptop",
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "hysteresis: a clear lead does",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 30, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 0, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 0}],
      "previous": "laptop",
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "hysteresis never keeps a device whose screen is off",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 0, "screen_on": false, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 0}],
      "previous": "s21",
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "two phones and the laptop: the one touched last wins (laptop's view)",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 40, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 30, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}, {"device": "s22", "idle": 3, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s22"
    },
    {
      "name": "the same moment from the first phone's view",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 30, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 40, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}, {"device": "s22", "idle": 3, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s22"
    },
    {
      "name": "the same moment from the second phone's own view",
      "me": {"device": "s22", "idle": 3, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 40, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}, {"device": "s21", "idle": 30, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s22"
    },
    {
      "name": "a phone gone quiet (stale beat) is not there: the other phone is compared with the laptop",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 40, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 2, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 20000}, {"device": "s22", "idle": 30, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s22"
    },
    {
      "name": "the server names a phone but the second phone cannot reach it: they decide among themselves",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 10, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21"},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s21", "age_ms": 1000}, {"device": "s22", "idle": 2, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "laptop"
    },
    {
      "name": "the server names the second phone and every device sees it and agrees",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 1, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s22"},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 50, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s22", "age_ms": 1000}, {"device": "s22", "idle": 400, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "s22", "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s22"
    },
    {
      "name": "hysteresis among three: a stray touch on another phone does not take the island",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 60, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 10, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}, {"device": "s22", "idle": 9, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": "s21",
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "the server says vga and nobody here was touched within its limit: Mochi is on the panel, on no device",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 400, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 900, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga", "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": "s21",
      "expect": "vga"
    },
    {
      "name": "the same moment from the laptop's view",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 900, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 400, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga", "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": "laptop",
      "expect": "vga"
    },
    {
      "name": "a phone alone, reaching the server, not in use: the panel has him, the phone does not show him",
      "me": {"device": "s22", "idle": 1200, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "vga"
    },
    {
      "name": "a phone alone with its screen off and the server saying vga: the panel",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 5, "screen_on": false, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [],
      "previous": "s21",
      "expect": "vga"
    },
    {
      "name": "the server says vga but the phone was just picked up (its answer is a beat old): the phone",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 3, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 900, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga", "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "the server says vga; only the one touched within the limit counts, even against hysteresis",
      "me": {"device": "laptop", "idle": 310, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [{"device": "s21", "idle": 20, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga", "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": "laptop",
      "expect": "s21"
    },
    {
      "name": "vga is only the server's word when everyone agrees: a peer that cannot reach it makes us decide among ourselves",
      "me": {"device": "s21", "idle": 400, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": true, "server_active": "vga"},
      "peers": [{"device": "laptop", "idle": 900, "screen_on": true, "server_ok": false, "server_active": null, "age_ms": 1000}],
      "previous": null,
      "expect": "s21"
    }
  ]
}
